### 1. Login through gateway
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "player@arena.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 2. Get arenas WITHOUT token (should return 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/arenas

### 3. Get arenas WITH token
GET {{baseUrl}}/arenas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Create booking through gateway (no X-User-Id needed — gateway injects it)
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "arenaId": 1,
  "date": "2026-06-15",
  "startTime": "14:00",
  "endTime": "16:00"
}